        {
          "es": "La última vez, el Barong y Rangda bailaron su batalla que nunca termina.",
          "en": "Last time, the Barong and Rangda danced their battle that never ends."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta vez viajamos a los años 1300, a Bedahulu, el último reino del viejo Bali.",
          "en": "This time, we travel to the 1300s, to Bedahulu, the last kingdom of old Bali."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su mayor defensor era un gigante, y se llamaba Kebo Iwa.",
          "en": "Its greatest defender was a giant, and his name was Kebo Iwa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su historia es una leyenda local, contada en su aldea natal y en viejas crónicas balinesas.",
          "en": "His story is a local legend, told in his home village and in old Balinese chronicles."
        }
