        {
          "es": "Pronto sus padres ya no pudieron alimentarlo.",
          "en": "Soon his parents could not feed him anymore."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces la aldea hizo un trato con el joven gigante: ellos cocinarían para él, y él trabajaría para ellos.",
          "en": "So the village made a deal with the young giant: they would cook for him, and he would work for them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada día, las mujeres de la aldea cocinaban enormes ollas de arroz, solo para él.",
          "en": "Every day, the women of the village cooked huge pots of rice, just for him."
        }
