        {
          "es": "Cargaba piedras que diez hombres no podían levantar, y ayudaba a construir templos.",
          "en": "He carried stones that ten men could not lift, and he helped to build temples."
        },
        {
          "es": "La leyenda local hasta dice que talló los relieves de roca de Yeh Pulu con las uñas.",
          "en": "Local legend even says he carved the rock reliefs at Yeh Pulu with his fingernails."
        }
