          "es": "Su primer ministro, Gajah Mada, juró poner muchas islas bajo su dominio. Bali estaba en su lista.",
          "en": "Its prime minister, Gajah Mada, swore an oath to bring many islands under its rule. Bali was on his list."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese juramento está registrado en una vieja crónica javanesa, el Pararaton.",
          "en": "That oath is recorded in an old Javanese chronicle, the Pararaton."
