        {
          "es": "En Java, le pidieron un favor antes de la boda: cavar un pozo.",
          "en": "In Java, they asked him for one favor before the wedding: to dig a well."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kebo Iwa cavó cada vez más hondo, hasta que solo se oía su voz.",
          "en": "Kebo Iwa dug deeper and deeper, until only his voice could be heard."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los soldados empezaron a tirar piedras dentro del pozo.",
          "en": "Then the soldiers began to throw stones down the well."
        },
        {
          "es": "En algunos relatos, él las atrapaba y las devolvía. Al final, echaron cal, y lo enterraron.",
          "en": "In some tellings, he caught them and threw them back. In the end, they poured in lime, and buried him."
        }
